OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 5,000 evacuated in City of
OL,4,ALondon gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 4,700 people have been evacuated
OL,7,Fin the City of London after a gas leak.
OL,9,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) said it
OL,10,Fwas called at 10:55 BST to Old Broad
OL,11,FStreet, where crews found a ruptured
OL,12,Fsix-inch gas main at a six-storey
OL,13,Foffice building.
OL,15,FA Cadent gas spokesperson said the pipe
OL,16,Fwas "severely damaged by a private
OL,17,Fconstruction team" and its teams are
OL,18,Fon-site carrying out repairs.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
